  "description": "EHISOH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C38 H48 N18 O20 Tb4 2+,2(C1 H4 O1),2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.541-4.238 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.67-130.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(μ3-O2)2(bshHtz)2(MeOH)6(NO3)2][NO3]2·2MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
